|kde_governance_runtime_dependencies_policy
  |document_id=DEP-001
  |version=1.0.0
  |date=2026-07-26
  |status=APPROVED
  |authority=KDE Governance (KDE-INV-052 REC-001)
|purpose
|policy_statement
  |rule_1_dependency_documentation
    |rule_2_required_fields
      |table
        ||['Field', 'Required', 'Description']
        ||['module_name', 'Yes', 'Name of the Python module (pip install name)']
        ||['minimum_version', 'Yes', 'Minimum required version']
        ||['import_statement', 'Yes', 'How the module is imported in code']
        ||['description', 'Yes', 'Purpose of the dependency']
      |rule_3_dependency_installation
        |rule_4_standard_library
      |current_dependencies
        |table
          ||['Module', 'Version', 'Purpose']
          ||['yaml (PyYAML)', '>= 5.0', 'YAML parsing for configuration files']
        |standard_library_modules
          |items
            ||json, os, sys, time, datetime, pathlib, typing, dataclasses, enum
      |compliance_verification
        |check_dependency_documentation
          |items
            ||[ ] `python_dependencies.required` exists in requirements.json
            ||[ ] All external dependencies are listed with required fields
            ||[ ] Standard library modules are documented
            ||[ ] `python_dependencies_installed` is in system_checks
          |check_runtime_load
        |violations
          |table
            ||['Violation', 'Severity', 'Remediation']
            ||['Missing dependency documentation', 'HIGH', 'Add to requirements.json']
            ||['Missing dependency causes load failure', 'CRITICAL', 'Document and install dependency']
            ||['Standard library not documented', 'MEDIUM', 'Add to standard_library list']
        |enforcement
          |bootstrap_verification=Runtime bootstrap checks dependencies
          |pre-load_verification=Any code loading KDE Runtime must verify dependencies
          |documentation_requirements=PRs adding dependencies must update requirements.json
        |related_policies
          |items
            ||ENV-001: Environment Verification Policy
            ||NAMING-CONVENTIONS.md: Artifact naming requirements
        |version_history
          |table
            ||['Version', 'Date', 'Change', 'Authority']
            ||['1.0.0', '2026-07-26', 'Initial policy', 'KDE-INV-052 REC-001']
        |status=ENFORCED
        |review_date=Upon any dependency-related incident